p playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1337030/extras/e23e556c11f12c0508905885edd17c19.poster.avif?t=1726378550\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1337030/extras/e23e556c11f12c0508905885edd17c19.webm?t=1726378550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1337030/extras/e23e556c11f12c0508905885edd17c19.mp4?t=1726378550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The appearance of an uninvited guest</li></ul>Different uninvited guests threaten trains depending on the region! Gather all the clues to kill the uninvited guests and knock them down!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>multi-ending</li></ul>The end of this journey is not one. What will be the end of the world?<br><br>* XBOX360 Pad Support",
